{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am writing from Trier, where the heat has been oppressive since my arrival yesterday. The city is a curiosity rather than a wonder; the ruins are merely stones, yet they remind one that freedom is not built in a day. I spent the morning walking with the innkeeper’s brother, who showed me the old Roman walls and an estate belonging to a relation of Eichhorn. It is strange to see such grandeur decayed, much like the old world order we are leaving behind.\n\nIn the afternoon, I visited the churches. There is a solemnity here that contrasts sharply with the bustle of Berlin. I am well, though tired from the journey. I think of you and the boys constantly. The journey to France continues tomorrow. I hope this letter finds you in good health.\n\nYours ever,\nG. W. F. H."}}],"created":1795219202,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":956,"total_tokens":1138,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-a5cgWXPw4YhoL9dow5KwK2XLoZgWdu0a","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":956,"prompt_ms":906.435,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9481537656903765,"prompt_per_second":1054.6812512756017,"predicted_n":182,"predicted_ms":4278.043,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.63559668508287,"predicted_per_second":42.30906514964904}}